{{define "main"}}
    <div class="register-head">
        <h1>No accounts yet</h1>
    </div>
    <p>This database has no accounts, so there is no register to show.</p>
    <p><a class="cta" href="/accounts/new">Add your first account</a></p>
    <p class="muted">
        To see what a register looks like before entering anything of your own, choose
        <strong>Close checkbook</strong> on the left and then open the sample household from the
        page you land on. It is a small household held in memory: nothing is written to disk, and
        this checkbook is one click away again.
    </p>
{{end}}
